flowchart TB
  accTitle: The public boundary of DorkOS Cloud
  accDescr: Optional local Cloud clients use HTTPS. Legacy app-side paths coexist with the versioned public contract. The versioned client resolves authenticated instance identity before minting scoped inference credentials under the same current link. A Runs on choice selects credits. Claude Code uses session launch configuration, Codex a separate conversation home, OpenCode a sidecar-wide local relay, and Doe a first-turn inference binding. The token served list gates request formats; the environment variable only disables credits. The managed remote consumer is built and off until its switch is set. The session relay is a third path that dials a hub, not Cloud. The existing tunnel is a separate route to the local server. Hub, computer and directory families are contracts; only hub assignment and the viewer-open wake have app consumers.
  subgraph app["Open-source app · local machine"]
    local["Local DorkOS server<br/>Runs without a Cloud link"]
    legacy["Cloud link + managed services client<br/>Existing /api/auth and /api/instances calls"]
    versioned["Versioned client<br/>@dork-labs/cloud-api/client<br/>Current credential / origin / generation"]
    runtime["Runs on: credits + current link<br/>Claude Code: session · Codex: conversation<br/>OpenCode: sidecar via local credits relay<br/>Doe: first-turn source binding<br/>Format gated by token served list"]
    remote["Managed remote consumer · built<br/>Command stream · leases / acks · journal<br/>Enrolment · edge proof · ingress<br/>Off until DORKOS_MANAGED_REMOTE"]
    tunnel["Existing tunnel manager<br/>ngrok SDK · optional"]
    relayMac["Session relay · built, default off<br/>Dials the pinned hub, not Cloud"]
    local --> legacy
    local --> versioned
    local --> runtime
    local --> remote
    local --> tunnel
    local --> relayMac
  end
  control["Configured service origin<br/>Link: DORKOS_CLOUD_URL, defaults to website<br/>/v1: DORKOS_CLOUD_API_URL, defaults to the service<br/>Account handover is route-specific"]
  inference["Inference endpoint<br/>URL + scoped token returned at runtime"]
  contract["Public contract: packages/cloud-api<br/>Accounts · instances · managed services<br/>entitlements · seats · remote access · inference<br/>Spaces on DorkOS: start / claim / moves<br/>Hubs · agent computers · computers · directory"]
  hubrole["A hub (same program, role hub)<br/>Reads its assignment · owner pin"]
  edge["Tunnel service"]
  browser["Remote browser"]
  legacy -->|"HTTPS: link / heartbeat<br/>Managed actions / event pull + ack"| control
  versioned -->|"HTTPS /v1 bearer auth<br/>Session identity → mint"| control
  remote -->|"Command SSE + lease/ack<br/>when switched on"| control
  contract -.->|"Wire schema, not deployment proof"| control
  hubrole -->|"GET /v1/hubs/self/assignment"| control
  relayMac -->|"Signed WebSocket frames"| hubrole
  runtime -->|"Inference protocol over HTTPS<br/>when chosen and available"| inference
  tunnel -->|"Outbound tunnel connection"| edge
  browser -->|"HTTPS / WSS"| edge
  edge -->|"Forward app traffic through tunnel"| local
  community["Space server API · implemented<br/>Scoped keys · limits · usage<br/>The space server owns content and storage"]
  control -.->|"Space-management contract · availability-dependent<br/>HTTPS server API; no database access"| community
